Let me pray for you. Then we will close this service.

852
01:46:10.706 --> 01:46:14.706
Father in the name of Jesus, I thank you for your Son.

853
01:46:14.706 --> 01:46:18.706
Lord, I thank you that we do not have to be Christians only on Sunday morning.

854
01:46:18.706 --> 01:46:20.706
But that you go with us throughout the week.

855
01:46:20.706 --> 01:46:22.706
You are the God of every day.

856
01:46:22.706 --> 01:46:25.706
You are the God, the Holy Spirit who goes with us.

857
01:46:25.706 --> 01:46:27.706
And church, I want to encourage all of us.

858
01:46:27.706 --> 01:46:29.706
Know that God is with you.

859
01:46:29.706 --> 01:46:32.706
And that He cares for you and loves you.

860
01:46:32.706 --> 01:46:35.706
And that through the blood of Jesus we are more than conquerors.

861
